| \`gutter\` | no | enum: 3xs \\\\| 2xs \\\\| xs \\\\| sm \\\\| md \\\\| lg \\\\| xl \\\\| 2xl \\\\| 3xl \\\\| 4xl | Spacing between main content and footer. |

