### \`tls.l.grid\` — Grid

Grid layout with configurable columns, rows, and gap. _(family: layout; keywords: grid, columns, rows, table)_

**When:** Use to arrange child blocks in a rows × columns grid.
**Avoid:** Do not use for simple two-column layouts — use tls.l.split instead.

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`columns\` | no | number (min 1, max 12) | Number of grid columns. |
| \`rows\` | no | number (min 1, max 12) | Number of grid rows. |
| \`gap\` | no | enum: 3xs \\\\| 2xs \\\\| xs \\\\| sm \\\\| md \\\\| lg \\\\| xl \\\\| 2xl \\\\| 3xl \\\\| 4xl | Spacing between grid cells. |

