| \`direction\` | no | enum: x \\\\| y | Lay out repetitions horizontally (x) or vertically (y). |
| \`gap\` | no | enum: 3xs \\\\| 2xs \\\\| xs \\\\| sm \\\\| md \\\\| lg \\\\| xl \\\\| 2xl \\\\| 3xl \\\\| 4xl | Spacing between repeated items. |

